{"ref":"BDB, עֻזִּיָּהוּ","hw":"עֻזִּיָּהוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֻזִּיָּהוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֻזִּיָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>my strength is</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>; cf. OHeb. <span dir=\"rtl\">עזיו</span> Lzb<sup>338</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  Οζειας, but also Αζαριας: king of Judah = <span dir=\"rtl\">עַזֲרְיָהוּ</span>: <strong>a.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">עֻזִּיָּהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:32\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.32\">2 K 15:32</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:34\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.34\">34</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.1\">2 Ch 26:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.18\">18</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:23\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 27:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.27.2\">27:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.1\">Is 1:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 6:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.6.1\">6:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.1\">7:1</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">עֻזִּיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.13\">2 K 15:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:30\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.30\">30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 1:1\" href=\"/Hosea.1.1\">Ho 1:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:1\" href=\"/Amos.1.1\">Am 1:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:5\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.5\">Zc 14:5</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">עֻזִּיָּהוּ</span> father of an officer of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.25\">1 Ch 27:25</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">עֻזִּיָּה</span> Levite name <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.9\">1 Ch 6:9</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  id.<em>:</em> priest with foreign wife <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:21\" href=\"/Ezra.10.21\">Ezr 10:21</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  id.<em>:</em> name in Judah <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.4\">Ne 11:4</a> (also v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.5\">5</a> 𝔊 for <span dir=\"rtl\">חזיה</span>).—Vid. also <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, יַעֲזִיָּ֫הוּ\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_יַעֲזִיָּ֫הוּ\">יַעֲזִיָּהוּ</a>.","next":"BDB, עֻזִּיָּא","prev":"BDB, עָזִּיאֵלִי"}